rem BC-250-X Flash Mode — generated at flash time, do not hand-edit.
rem Proven community flow for BC-250 (AfuEfix64 in UEFI shell).
rem The staged BIOS image is copied beside this file as BC250X.ROM
rem and validated (size + SHA-256 + ROM ID) by BC-250-X *before* reboot.
@echo -off
echo BC-250-X Flash Mode
echo DO NOT POWER OFF. A flash can look hung - wait at least 15 minutes.
echo Logging to bc250x-flash.log ...
rem Flags /P /N /B /K /RLC:E are the field-proven set from the community
rem UEFI firmware-menu flow for BC-250 (see docs/FLASH-AND-PRAY.md).
AfuEfix64.efi BC250X.ROM /P /N /B /K /RLC:E
echo Flash command finished. Remove power, clear CMOS (battery out 60s),
echo then boot BC-250-X again to finish the post-flash verification wizard.
